** sch_path: /foss/designs/BTDay4-Ex/Ex4_Lecture4.sch
**.subckt Ex4_Lecture4
XM1 VON VIP net1 VSS sg13_lv_nmos w=30u l=5u ng=1 m=2 mm_ok=1
